## Quality Assurance

### Quality Assurance Strategy

- Implement test-driven development for critical components
- Maintain minimum 80% code coverage for core modules
- Create isolated tests with proper mocking of external dependencies
- Focus on behavior-driven tests that validate user experiences
- Use property-based testing for complex algorithms
- Implement contract tests for Nostr integrations
- Prioritize tests for critical payment and security functionality
- Use snapshot testing for UI components to prevent regressions
- Automate accessibility testing in the CI pipeline
- Regularly perform load testing on Nostr relay integrations
